Eclipse Paho MQTT C and C++ client libraries

The Paho MQTT C and C++ client libraries are made available under the
Eclipse Public License v2.0 and Eclipse Distribution License v1.0.

The complete license texts are available from the upstream distributions:

https://github.com/eclipse-paho/paho.mqtt.c/blob/v1.3.14/epl-v20
https://github.com/eclipse-paho/paho.mqtt.c/blob/v1.3.14/edl-v10

This project obtains these libraries at configure time through CMake
FetchContent. The files and copyright notices in the fetched distributions
remain subject to their upstream licenses.